<title>USA: THQ says over-allotment exercised.</title>
<headline>THQ says over-allotment exercised.</headline>
<dateline>CALABASAS, Calif. 1997-03-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>THQ Inc on Monday said underwriters of its recent stock offering have exercised an over-allotment option to acquire 225,000 shares of newly issued common stock at $7.50 a share.</p>
<p>Net proceeds from the over-allotment sale is about $1.55 million, putting total net proceeds at over $11.5 million.</p>
<p>THQ, a publisher and distributor of video and PC game software, completed a public offering of 1.5 million shares on Feb. 11.</p>
